TITLE Equilibrium of pure water with CO2 at log PCO2 = -3.4, check SI of CH4

SOLUTION 1 Pure water at pH 7.0
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mol/L
    water     1.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)    -3.4    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     ch4_si.sel
    -reset    false
    -si       CH4(g)

END
